<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cairn to acquire rest of Command.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cairn to acquire rest of Command.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cairn Energy Plc said on Friday it had secured 91.16 percent of Command Petroleum and would proceed to compulsory acquisition of outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Cairn's A$1.10 per share cash bid closed on December 12, following the closure of its two-for-13 share offer on November 22. Command's key asset is the Ravva oilfield off the Indian coast, which it operates.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
